	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;The given sentence follows rule number &amp;lsquo;1&amp;rsquo;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;according to the rule&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;, the error lies in Part &amp;lsquo;C&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/span&gt;

