&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Shortcut Trick&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Percentage of tiles of type C = 30%&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Percentage of tiles of type A = 20%&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Required percentage = {(30 - 20)/20}&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 100%&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; (10/20) &amp;times; 100%&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 50%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&amp;there4; The number of tiles of type C is 50% more than number of tiles of type A&lt;/strong&gt;

