&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Given:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Rita : Sita = 5 : 7&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After 4 years, (Rita + Sita) = 68&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Mita is 4 years younger than Sita&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formula used:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let Rita = 5k, Sita = 7k &amp;rArr; Sum = 12k&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Future sum after 4 years each: (Rita + 4) + (Sita + 4) = (Rita + Sita) + 8&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calculations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; (Rita + Sita) + 8 = 68&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Rita + Sita = 60&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 12k = 60&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; k = 60 &amp;divide; 12 = 5&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Sita = 7k = 7 &amp;times; 5 = 35&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Mita = Sita &amp;minus; 4 = 35 &amp;minus; 4 = 31&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;there4; Mita&amp;rsquo;s present age = 31 years.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

