&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;Here, persons are U, V, W, X, Y and Z.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;1) Three persons sit between Y and Z.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;2) U sits second to the left of Y.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;3) U sits third to the right of V.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/26/03/IMG-2035%20Ratna%205-2-2026_D12.png&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 434px; height: 211px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;4) X and Z sit immediate right to each other.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;5) X and V face in same direction.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;6) W sits two places away from V and faces in same direction.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/26/03/IMG-2035%20Ratna%205-2-2026_D13.png&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 434px; height: 211px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;7) U faces towards the centre. Therefore, case 2 is eliminated. Hence, the final arrangement is as follows&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/26/03/IMG-2035%20Ratna%205-2-2026_D14.png&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 180px; height: 195px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;Since, each person except YX sits immediate next to each other whereas three persons sit between Y and X.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;Hence, &lt;strong&gt;the correct answer is YX.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

